		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Build a clockwork familiar that lasts a day.</em></p><p><strong>Cast Time: 1 minute.</strong> You create a familiar per Magical Familiar, though it's mechanical in nature and lasts 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> 1 Action, Burst, Damage: STRd6 Fire; the familiar is destroyed.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on Perception (WIL) while the familiar is active.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Mechanical Familiar gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Mechanical Familiar (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Passive: Offers advantage on Perception (WIL) checks while the familiar is active (tick it in the check dialog).</em></p>",
